<article class="env-lemma" id="007K">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/007K">Lemma <span data-tag="007K">6.14.2</span>.</a> Let $X$ be a topological space. Let $\mathcal{O} \to \mathcal{O}'$ be a morphism of presheaves of rings on $X$. Let $\mathcal{F}$ be a presheaf of $\mathcal{O}$-modules. Let $x \in X$. We have </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \mathcal{F}_ x \otimes _{\mathcal{O}_ x} \mathcal{O}'_ x = (\mathcal{F} \otimes _{p, \mathcal{O}} \mathcal{O}')_ x  \]
</div>
  <p> as $\mathcal{O}'_ x$-modules. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
